        <description>Status of the ZUGFeRD/Factur-X hybrid PDF/A-3 merge (CII XML embedded into the base invoice PDF). Set by the async merge process, mirrors the existing Subscription25__Email_Status__c / Subscription25__UBL_Email_Status__c pattern.</description>
